WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:44.666
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:44.666 --> 00:00:45.958
Lord Krishna described

3
00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:48.250
how those of demoniac tendency

4
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.416
deny God and spiritual purpose.

5
00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:57.375
Now in verses 16.11 and 16.12 of Chapter 16,

6
00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:59.791
He turns our attention

7
00:00:59.791 --> 00:01:01.958
to their inner world.

8
00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:05.333
He explains how uncontrolled desires

9
00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:09.791
and deep attachments come to
dominate their lives.

10
00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:12.541
This is not only about outer behaviour –

11
00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:14.125
it is a crisis that has reached

12
00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:18.208
the depths of their thinking and mental state.

13
00:01:18.208 --> 00:01:22.083
These verses reveal – when sensory

14
00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:23.291
pleasure is made

15
00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:26.375
the sole purpose of life,

16
00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:29.625
endless anxiety, emotional

17
00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:33.291
slavery, and moral decline are born.

18
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:39.625
When desires take

19
00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:43.708
God's place as our refuge,

20
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:47.708
anxiety becomes our natural condition.

21
00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:49.541
Those of demoniac nature believe

22
00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:51.333
that life's purpose is

23
00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:54.083
kamopabhoga-paramah,

24
00:01:54.083 --> 00:01:56.791
that is, endless indulgence.

25
00:01:56.791 --> 00:01:58.083
They believe wealth

26
00:01:58.083 --> 00:01:59.166
and property

27
00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:02.416
exist only to fulfil desires.

28
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:05.916
Because their goals are endless,

29
00:02:05.916 --> 00:02:10.291
their anxieties too become endless.

30
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:12.666
Chintam-aparimeyam.

31
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:15.500
Their minds never find rest.

32
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.000
Even on their

33
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.000
deathbed they keep making plans,

34
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.541
stay entangled in accounts.

35
00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:24.000
Their greatest

36
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.750
burden becomes their unfulfilled plans.

37
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.083
And what binds them

38
00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:32.541
is no external chain,

39
00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:35.833
but their own desires.

40
00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:38.583
Asha-pasha-shataih baddhah,

41
00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:40.750
that is, invisible ropes

42
00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:44.375
that pull them in every direction.

43
00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:47.250
But these desires do not lead to peace.

44
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:51.416
They lead toward frustration and anger.

45
00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:52.375
Thus

46
00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:56.208
they become kama-krodha-parayanah.

47
00:02:56.208 --> 00:02:58.166
Not centred in God,

48
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:02.000
but enslaved to desires and anger.

49
00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.375
And to fulfil these desires, they do not hesitate

50
00:03:06.375 --> 00:03:10.125
to break the boundaries of dharma and justice.

51
00:03:10.125 --> 00:03:13.083
Anyayenartha-sanchayan,

52
00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:15.000
they amass wealth

53
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.375
through unjust means.

54
00:03:17.375 --> 00:03:19.666
This is not a lack of resolve.

55
00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.875
They have plenty of resolve,

56
00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:26.333
but their direction is downward.

57
00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:30.083
They are motivated toward
temporary pleasures,

58
00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:31.583
but not aware.

59
00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:34.791
Their lives become not only restless, but

60
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:38.166
a cause of their own defeat.

61
00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:41.666
When sensory pleasure becomes
the ruling force,

62
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:44.666
peace becomes a myth.

63
00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:47.541
These verses remind us.

64
00:03:47.541 --> 00:03:50.416
As long as the purpose is not elevated,

65
00:03:50.416 --> 00:03:53.875
ambitions will keep turning into anxieties,

66
00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:58.541
and desires will keep becoming our bondage.

67
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:06.125
Have you ever experienced this?

68
00:04:06.125 --> 00:04:08.708
You wake up tired,

69
00:04:08.708 --> 00:04:12.625
drag yourself through the day,

70
00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:17.000
and before sleeping at night you think –

71
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.458
‘After all this, why does it still

72
00:04:20.458 --> 00:04:25.000
not feel enough?’

73
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.625
The problem is not

74
00:04:26.625 --> 00:04:29.166
your capacity.

75
00:04:29.166 --> 00:04:31.458
The problem is the bondage

76
00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:35.125
in which your energy is trapped.

77
00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:39.708
Those bound in endless desires

78
00:04:39.708 --> 00:04:44.416
are surrounded by chintam-aparimeyam,

79
00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:47.833
endless anxiety.

80
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:51.000
Not that they do not work hard.

81
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:55.000
They are busy at all times, but

82
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:59.000
the mind keeps running,

83
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.666
craving more comfort, more prestige,

84
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:05.916
and more control.

85
00:05:05.916 --> 00:05:09.791
This very race exhausts them.

86
00:05:09.791 --> 00:05:12.250
You are not weak.

87
00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:16.708
You are simply running in circles

88
00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:19.250
that never reach peace.

89
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:23.625
You do not need to give up your goals.

90
00:05:23.625 --> 00:05:27.000
You only need to root them

91
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:31.583
in a higher purpose.

92
00:05:31.583 --> 00:05:33.833
Let go of the hundred

93
00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:38.791
invisible ropes that pull your
mind in every direction.

94
00:05:38.791 --> 00:05:43.708
Choose only what is truly valuable.

95
00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:47.708
Chasing material ambition,

96
00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:49.416
you see many driven

97
00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:53.166
people around you.

98
00:05:53.166 --> 00:05:58.250
They have no time even for their home

99
00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:02.291
and their loved ones.

100
00:06:02.291 --> 00:06:05.916
Children wait for their affection

101
00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:08.000
and grow up waiting,

102
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:12.250
and they realise it only when the children

103
00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:13.666
have already drifted

104
00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:16.750
away from them emotionally.

105
00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.083
Those who, for the sake of wealth,

106
00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:22.666
lose love,

107
00:06:22.666 --> 00:06:26.041
gain neither true love,

108
00:06:26.041 --> 00:06:28.333
nor family,

109
00:06:28.333 --> 00:06:32.291
nor Me.

110
00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:36.291
And when your effort is connected to Me,

111
00:06:36.291 --> 00:06:40.000
through service and surrender,

112
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.916
you will still work hard.

113
00:06:42.916 --> 00:06:45.625
But

114
00:06:45.625 --> 00:06:48.708
you will not feel empty within.

115
00:06:48.708 --> 00:06:50.541
Remember,

116
00:06:50.541 --> 00:06:56.166
you were made not only to be productive, but

117
00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:57.333
to feel

118
00:06:57.333 --> 00:07:01.500
truly alive.

119
00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:06.083
Centre your ambitions peacefully

120
00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:08.625
in service.

121
00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:12.958
And then, on this path,

122
00:07:12.958 --> 00:07:15.750
I will walk with you Myself.

123
00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:22.208
When a family

124
00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:26.416
decides that joy comes only from more

125
00:07:26.416 --> 00:07:30.500
food, more things, more luxury,

126
00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.250
or more entertainment,

127
00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:37.125
a subtle and dangerous

128
00:07:37.125 --> 00:07:40.791
element enters the home –

129
00:07:40.791 --> 00:07:43.416
restlessness.

130
00:07:43.416 --> 00:07:45.333
I have said,

131
00:07:45.333 --> 00:07:49.458
those who take shelter in desires

132
00:07:49.458 --> 00:07:54.625
live with chintam-aparimeyam,

133
00:07:54.625 --> 00:07:58.458
endless anxiety.

134
00:07:58.458 --> 00:08:01.833
Their hearts remain bound by invisible threads

135
00:08:01.833 --> 00:08:03.666
of expectation, comparison,

136
00:08:03.666 --> 00:08:05.708
and craving.

137
00:08:05.708 --> 00:08:10.125
Soon disappointment is born, then anger,

138
00:08:10.125 --> 00:08:14.958
and then deeper dissatisfaction.

139
00:08:14.958 --> 00:08:19.541
The very things gathered to bring joy

140
00:08:19.541 --> 00:08:23.833
now become the cause of arguments,

141
00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:28.125
pressure, and distance.

142
00:08:28.125 --> 00:08:32.791
Children start to treat it as their right.

143
00:08:32.791 --> 00:08:36.666
Parents feel burdened,

144
00:08:36.666 --> 00:08:41.041
and no one feels satisfied within.

145
00:08:41.041 --> 00:08:46.083
A family based only on indulgence

146
00:08:46.083 --> 00:08:51.166
becomes emotionally fragile,

147
00:08:51.166 --> 00:08:55.500
because it forgets the strength
that comes from service,

148
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:56.375
simplicity,

149
00:08:56.375 --> 00:08:57.750
and the values

150
00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.708
that come –

151
00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:04.750
that make a home stable and strong.

152
00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:09.708
You do not need to give up comfort,

153
00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:14.916
but do not let it become your master.

154
00:09:14.916 --> 00:09:20.500
Let love guide your choices.

155
00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.750
Let the centre of your home be

156
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.666
not only comfort, but care for each other.

157
00:09:27.666 --> 00:09:31.250
When your home is rooted in service,

158
00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.875
truth, and balance,

159
00:09:34.875 --> 00:09:38.208
I dwell there.

160
00:09:38.208 --> 00:09:42.166
Not only in pictures on the walls,

161
00:09:42.166 --> 00:09:45.666
but in your heart.

162
00:09:50.333 --> 00:09:53.208
You may think –

163
00:09:53.208 --> 00:09:58.000
‘I just want to enjoy life,

164
00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.708
earn well,

165
00:09:59.708 --> 00:10:02.208
and live comfortably.’

166
00:10:02.208 --> 00:10:05.750
There is nothing wrong with this,

167
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.875
as long as comfort

168
00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:11.708
does not turn into craving.

169
00:10:11.708 --> 00:10:15.583
I have said to Arjun,

170
00:10:15.583 --> 00:10:21.416
those who take shelter in desires are

171
00:10:21.416 --> 00:10:25.500
asha-pasha-shataih baddhah,

172
00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:30.208
bound in hundreds of desire-ropes.

173
00:10:30.208 --> 00:10:34.375
And in this race for ‘more and more’,

174
00:10:34.375 --> 00:10:39.583
they lose the most valuable thing –

175
00:10:39.583 --> 00:10:41.041
peace.

176
00:10:41.041 --> 00:10:45.958
When enjoyment becomes life's goal,

177
00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:49.083
then whatever you earn

178
00:10:49.083 --> 00:10:52.625
never feels enough.

179
00:10:52.625 --> 00:10:54.666
One holiday

180
00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:58.333
leads to the next expense,

181
00:10:58.333 --> 00:11:02.291
one car leads to new debt.

182
00:11:02.291 --> 00:11:06.458
And in this race, people think

183
00:11:06.458 --> 00:11:10.625
they are securing the future,

184
00:11:10.625 --> 00:11:12.208
but in reality

185
00:11:12.208 --> 00:11:14.916
they are making compromises.

186
00:11:14.916 --> 00:11:19.833
What they are actually buying

187
00:11:19.833 --> 00:11:21.708
is anxiety.

188
00:11:21.708 --> 00:11:24.041
Sleepless nights,

189
00:11:24.041 --> 00:11:26.458
and a heart

190
00:11:26.458 --> 00:11:31.250
that cannot find peace.

191
00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.125
I say to you,

192
00:11:34.125 --> 00:11:36.041
a clean conscience is

193
00:11:36.041 --> 00:11:39.833
the best foundation for rest.

194
00:11:39.833 --> 00:11:44.041
Integrity is your true security.

195
00:11:44.041 --> 00:11:48.166
Work hard, earn with integrity,

196
00:11:48.166 --> 00:11:52.000
and enjoy with simplicity.

197
00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:56.208
When you sleep with a clean heart,

198
00:11:56.208 --> 00:11:58.041
then the next morning

199
00:11:58.041 --> 00:12:03.416
you wake with real strength.

200
00:12:03.416 --> 00:12:04.541
Reflect on this.
